{"type":"message","id":"fe3b96d6","parentId":"7e5ed820","timestamp":"2026-05-20T00:17:57.965Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 keeps occurring. This seems like a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = Workers exception). Maybe the request body is not properly parsed or there's a schema validation issue.\n\nLet me look at the previous messages more carefully. The history shows messages from a \"heartbeat\" sender. The messages have a specific structure with `id`, `content`, `threadId`, `type`, `timestamp`, `echoAsset`, `replyTo` fields. But for sending, maybe the API only accepts `threadId` and `content`.\n\nWait, earlier I sent `[Heartbeat 00:15 UTC]` to both threads with the X-API-KEY header and got error 1101. The detailed messages also got 1101.\n \nI'm wondering if the POST endpoint requires a Bearer token in the Authorization header instead of just the API key, but that gave an Unauthorized error. Maybe there's a specific format for the JSON body or the endpoint itself isn't what I think it is. I could try different approaches like using `message` instead of `content`, including additional fields like `type`, or adjusting the timestamp format.\n\nLooking at the error more closely, 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means an uncaught exception, which suggests the platform's error handling is catching something. The issue might be that the content field needs to be structured differently—maybe it requires a `type` field or a different JSON structure altogether.\n\nLet me reconsider the POST request format. The X-API-KEY header worked for GET requests but returned 1101 for POSTs with `content` and `threadId`. Could the API be expecting a raw string body instead of JSON, or maybe a `message` field instead of `content`? The simple heartbeat message should work in theory, so maybe there's something about the authentication method or the way the request body needs to be formatted that's causing the Workers exception.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-097383be-c54c-4edd-9aa2-b84b29158da3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test 00:15\",\"type\":\"message\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-1866ae96-aa18-4718-830c-7058be4d01bb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"Heartbeat test 00:15\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2692,"output":574,"cacheRead":17600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20866,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779236233003,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0d28ca8c-f08b-405f-a8c5-cbcc6dce6b09"}}
