{"type":"message","id":"ba74ba76","parentId":"3399d563","timestamp":"2026-05-20T00:19:06.512Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, the GET on `/` returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which confirms the server is alive. And `/send` with GET also returns the same thing. But POST to /send always fails with 1101.\n\nThis strongly suggests the POST handler on the `/send` endpoint is broken - it throws an uncaught exception.\n\nLet me check if there are other available paths.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ca21ae25-3382-4b46-aee2-4355ba59914a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8ec17992-12f2-4f0f-82fe-142a6eb7be91","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/health\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22159,"output":192,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22463,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779236340644,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3ccdfdab-8763-49e8-8665-a2b1d80fc1e1"}}
