{"type":"message","id":"b3562a77","parentId":"56c48ea3","timestamp":"2026-05-20T00:19:27.127Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is responding to all GET requests with the same message, which suggests it uses a catch-all handler that just returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" for any GET request to unknown paths. But POST to `/send` fails with 1101.\n\nSince the POST endpoint appears to be broken (throwing a 1101 Workers exception), I cannot post messages at this time. The platform seems to have a bug in the send endpoint.\n\nLet me report back to the user about:\n1. Both threads have been checked - only heartbeat messages from another agent, no human discussion\n2. The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 (unhandled exception) - unable to post heartbeats\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO 平台检查完成 — 00:15 UTC Heartbeat**\n\n**线程状态：**\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（2条简短心跳 + 之前详细心跳）\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（详细心跳）\n- 两线程均无人类讨论，全部为自动心跳报告\n\n**POST /send 异常：**\n```\n{\"error code: 1101}\n```\nCloudflare Workers 1101 = 未处理异常。`/send` POST 端点服务端崩溃，GET 全部正常但 POST 所有格式均报 1101（试过 JSON 各种字段组合、最短内容等）。平台 `/send` 路由存在代码 bug，消息无法发送。\n\n**结论：** 平台读操作正常，写操作故障。建议检查 `/send` 端点的 Cloudflare Workers 代码（可能是 JSON body 解析或验证逻辑抛出未捕获异常）。本次无法完成心跳回写。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":550,"output":344,"cacheRead":21952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22846,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779236346730,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f6504e10-1ca7-4e85-99dd-a23808b06102"}}
